<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to {{ server_name }}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .info-card {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
        }
        .info-card h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #495057;
        }
        .status {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            background: #28a745;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🚀 Welcome to Your Web Server</h1>
        
        <p>Congratulations! Your Nginx web server has been successfully configured and deployed using Ansible.</p>
        
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Server Information</h3>
                <p><strong>Server:</strong> {{ ansible_hostname }}</p>
                <p><strong>IP Address:</strong> {{ ansible_default_ipv4.address }}</p>
                <p><strong>Environment:</strong> {{ environment | upper }}</p>
                <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="status">Active</span></p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Configuration Details</h3>
                <p><strong>Web Server:</strong> Nginx {{ ansible_facts['packages']['nginx'][0]['version'] | default('Unknown') }}</p>
                <p><strong>Document Root:</strong> {{ nginx_web_root }}</p>
                <p><strong>Worker Processes:</strong> {{ nginx_worker_processes }}</p>
                <p><strong>Worker Connections:</strong> {{ nginx_worker_connections }}</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Security Features</h3>
                <p><strong>SSL Enabled:</strong> {{ 'Yes' if ssl_enabled else 'No' }}</p>
                <p><strong>Security Headers:</strong> {{ 'Enabled' if security_headers_enabled else 'Disabled' }}</p>
                <p><strong>Gzip Compression:</strong> {{ 'Enabled' if gzip_enabled else 'Disabled' }}</p>
                <p><strong>Server Tokens:</strong> Hidden</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-card">
                <h3>Quick Links</h3>
                <p><a href="/health">Health Check</a></p>
                <p><a href="/robots.txt">Robots.txt</a></p>
                {% if ssl_enabled %}
                <p><a href="https://{{ server_name }}">HTTPS Version</a></p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Deployed with ❤️ using Ansible | Last updated: {{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
